        "created_at": "2015-03-09T19:15:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Nope. I just randomly attributed a year to it. Its ... somewhat pasted on theme right now, somewhat not. The theme is there, in the cards, but the 'reasoning' can adjusted as I do more research. I finally got it to a point today where I felt like I could put it out for some people to play around with (and expect LOTS of problems, as i've pretty much just played it schizo like by myself) so i threw on a quick blurb to explain the reasons why you are doing what your doing, and let it go at that.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>It's more fantastical/steampunk than realistic fiction as well.</p>",
